  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"Techniques utilized in this model, in order of appearance, include a suspended object, pop-up opening, object sewn to page, mylar encapsulation, recessed frame for hosing object, embossing, image window, rotating wheel, and slotted corner frame." -- colophon.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"My book arts students make this model every semester before embarking on their own personal version of the storage book. Whether through an object recessed in the page or one encapsulated in mylar, Hedi Kyle's influences have found their way into this small book, which in the spirit of Hedi, is now being passed on to my own students." --artist's statement.</subfield>
